{title: Ik Mulaqaat}
{artist: Ayushman Khurana Palak Muchhal Altamash}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m]Mai bhi hu tu bhi hai am [B]ne sa [C#]mne,        Dil ko [D#m]behka diya ishq [B]ke jam [D#m]ne
[D#m]Mai bhi hu tu bhi hai am [B]ne sa [C#]mne,        Dil ko [D#m]behka diya ishq [B]ke jam [C#]ne
Mu [C#]salsal nazar ba [A#m]rasti rhi,        Ta [C#]rastey hai hum bheegey
[B]barsat [D#m]me,        [D#m]Ik mulaqaat..
Ek [D#m]mulaqaat me baat he baat [C#]me,        Unka [B]yu muskuraana ga [C#]zab ho [D#m]gya
[D#m]Kal talak wo jo mere khayaalo me [C#]the,        Rooba [B]ru unka ana ga [C#]zab ho [D#m]gya
Mo [C#]habbat ki pehli mu [A#m]laqat ka,        As [C#]ar dekho na jaane [B]kab ho ga [D#m]ya
[D#m]Makhtawar dard ka kuch,        [F#]khayaal [C#]nahi hai
[G#m]Ek taraf me kahi ek,        [C#]taraf dil [D#m]kahi
Ehs [D#m]aas ki zameen pe kyu,        [F#]dhua uth [C#]raha hai
Hai [G#m]jal rha dil mera kyu,        [C#]pata kuch [D#m]nhi
[D#m]Kyu khayaalo me kuch,        Barf [B]si gir [C#]rahi
Rait [D#m]ki khwaahisho me,        [B]nami bhar [C#]rhi
Mu [C#]salsal nazar ba [A#m]rasti rhi,        Ta [C#]rastey hai hum bheegey
[B]barsat [D#m]me,        [D#m]Ik mulaqaat..
Ek [D#m]mulaqaat me baat he baat [C#]me,        Unka [B]yu muskuraana ga [C#]zab ho [D#m]gya
[D#m]Kal talak wo jo mere khayaalo me [C#]the,        Rooba [B]ru unka ana ga [C#]zab ho [D#m]gya
